1 NOTE {geni:about_me} McIntosh, Minnesota - Eliza Knutson passed away March 31, 2011 at the McIntosh Senior Living Home in McIntosh, Minnesota.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born February 16, 1916 in Tennessee. She was one of eleven children, seven girls and four boys.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza moved to Minnesota in 1939, where she met and married Oscar Knutson in 1941.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza helped on the farm and also worked at the Children's Home and Polaris for a number of years. She also did home health care. She was an avid gardener and took great pride in her flowers and vegetale gardens.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by sons, Mike (Sharri) Knutson of Roseau, Minnesota, Tim (Marilyn) Knutson of Roseau, Jefferey Knutson of Colorado; daughter, Sandra (James) Halvorson of Roseau; ten grandchildren; and seven great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is preceded in death by her parents; husband, Oscar; and her ten siblings.
2 CONT
