1 DEAT
2 DATE 6 MAR 2012
2 ADDR
3 CITY Roseau
3 STAE Minnesota
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Michael Dale Knutson passed away on March 6, 2012 at the LifeCare Roseau Manor, Roseau, MN at the age of 63 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael was born on January 8, 1949 in Roseau, MN to Eliza (Lewis) and Oscar Knutson. He grew up in Roseau and graduated from Roseau High LSchool in 1967. He and Sharri (Shortridge) were married on September 4, 1971 in Ross, MN. I
2 CONC n addition to working as a life-long farmer, he worked at Dorwart Motors as a mechanic for 10 years. He continued farming until his health declined after the flood of 2002.
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael loved to spend time in the outdoors. He enjoyed hunting, fishing, and snowmobiling. Everry chance he could, he would like to drive around and look at the fields. He loved his special golden retriever, Bella Jean.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by his wife, Sharri Knutson of Roseau; twin brother, Tim (Marilyn) of Roseau and sister, Sandi (Jim) Halvorson of Roseau; brother and sister-in-laws Marlo and Kay Johnson; many loved nieces and nephews; and many oth
2 CONC er friends and relatives.
2 CONT
