1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Koppangs did come from Koppang, Norway.  Ole Koppang's mother was Ronong Olson Koppang who was burn in Osterdallen Norway 6-18-1825.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole's father was Kristen Olson. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole was born in Koppang, Osterdalen Norway 10-18-1847.  He came to American in 1869 to Goodhue Country, MN.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Gurine Treseng was born in Treseng, Osterdalen, Norway and came to St. Paul, MN in 1874.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole and Gurine were married in St. Paul November 9, 1875.  Ole was from Stillwater then.  They spent a few years at Zumbrota, MN but in the spring of 1879 they came to ND and took a homestead in Traill County.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Koppang's sister, Martha, (Mrs. N.O. Sando) moved with them to ND from the Zumbrota, MN area.
