2 CONT Ancestry Family Tree  http://trees.ancestry.com/pt/AMTCitationRedir.aspx?tid=110512888&pid=80 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Johann came from Wurtenburg, Germany, on the Chesterfield, landing in Philadelphia 2 September 1749. Accompanied by wife, Anna Maria, and children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rowan County, North Carolina, deeds book 6, page 269, 9 June 1776, shows Jacob Reace to Peter Sprinkle 324 acres on south side of Deep Creek.
2 CONT
2 CONT His will, in the name Jacob Rees, made on 22 July 1771, named wife Ann, sons Marten and Valentine, executor Valentine. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ____________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/100860645/johann-jacob-ries
