1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Barbara Jean Shaffer, 69, of Ozark Acres, daughter of the late Charles and Adaline Durrow Ziemsen, was born July 9, 1935, in Milwaukee, Wis. She died Nov. 13, 2004, at White River Medical Center in Batesville.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was united in marriage to Franklin C. Shaffer Nov. 17, 1956, in Madison, Wis. She was a homemaker and member of Spring Lake Baptist Church at Ozark Acres.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include her children, Kimberly Ann (Billy Joe) Gann of Ozark Acres, Peggy Sue Shaffer of Williford, Michael Joseph Shaffer of Cape Cod, Mass., Karen Marie Shaffer of Ash Flat, and Scott Edward (Brandy) Shaffer of Jonesbo
2 CONC ro; sisters, Marjorie Metros of Shawano, Wis., and Betty Marshall of Port Angeles, Wash.; grandchildren, Amanda Graddy, James Emanuel, Melinda Yockey, Nicolette Johnson, Franklin Emanuel, Kyle Shaffer, and Lyndsey and Logan Shaffe
2 CONC r; great-grandchildren, Braden and Matthew Graddy and Brianna Johnson.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by her husband; a daughter, Nancy Jane Shaffer; and her parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT The funeral will be at 2 p.m. Nov. 17 at Spring Lake Baptist Church at Ozark Acres with burial at Baker Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 1. Kimberly Ann Shaffer (1957-) 2. Peggy Sue Shaffer (1959-) 3. Michael Joseph Shaffer (1961-) 4. Nancy Jane Shaffer (1964-1964) 5. Karen Marie Shaffer (1967-) 6. Scott Edward Shaffer (1975-)
2 CONT
2 CONT Grandchildren: 1. Amanda Renee Bohall (1978-) 2. James Allen Emanuel (1979-) 3. Melinda Dawn Osborn (1980-) 4. Nicolette Athena Bohall (1981-) 5. Andrew Scott Emanuel (1982-) 6. Kyle Morgan Shaffer (1991-) 7. Lyndsey Beth Shaffer 
2 CONC (2001-) 8. Logan Edward Shaffer (2003-) 9. Franklin Scott Shaffer (2004-)
2 CONT
2 CONT Great Grandchildren: 1. Braden Alexander Graddy (1997-) 2. Matthew Conner Graddy (2004-) 3. Brianna Lynn Johnson (2004-) 4. Nathaniel Ryen Devon Geasler (2006-) 5. Samuel Alexander Payton Geasler (2007-) 6. Lucien Franklin Lee Dul
2 CONC ier (2010-) 7. Anson Beau Cullen Dulier (2012-)
2 CONT
2 CONT 22 Descendants 21 Living as of 2020
