1 NOTE {geni:about_me} EVELYN'S OBITUARY Name:	Morgan , Evelyn Florence	  Visitation Details	
2 CONT     	Date:	
2 CONT  	Time:	
2 CONT  	Place:	 Funeral Service Details
2 CONT  	Date:	At a later date
2 CONT  	Time:	
2 CONT  	Place:	
2 CONT  	Cemetery:	 Evelyn Florence Seitler Morgan, 80 of Hallmark Care Center in Mt. Vernon, formerly of Anchorage, Alaska, died Friday, April 23, 2010 at Mercy Medical Center in Cedar Rapids.  As per Evelyn’s wishes private family serv
2 CONC ices will be held at a later date.  Brosh Chapel in Cedar Rapids is in charge of arrangements.
2 CONT
2 CONT Evelyn was born October 5, 1929 in Chicago, Illinois, the daughter of Frank and Florence Ries Seitler.  Evelyn was an accountant and tax consultant in Chicago and Anchorage for many years. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Evelyn is survived by her daughter Linda Louise (Bill) White of Olin; her brother Robert Seitler of Dickinson, Texas; a grandson Christopher Craig (Karen) Cowles of Rock Island, Illinois; three great-granddaughters Emma, Samantha,
2 CONC  and Bryanna Cowles; as well as eight nephews. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Evelyn was preceded in death by her grandparents Arthur and Louise Ries, her parents, a son Lynn Arthur Morgan, two sisters Carol Evans and Joyce Windsheimer, a sister in law Sandra Seitler, and a niece Susan Evans.
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorials may be directed to family at 29 King Avenue, Olin, Iowa 52320.
2 CONT
