1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Caroline Evans Caroline L. Evans, 76, passed away on May 11, 2008. She was born on October 2, 1931 to Frank and Florence Seitler in Chicago, IL. She is preceded in death by her parents husband, Aielt (Bud) W. Evans
2 CONC  daughter, Susan Jean Evans, grandson, Anthony Evans sister, Joyce Windsheimer. Caroline is survived by sons, Michael Evans, Steven Evans, Tracy Evans grandchildren, Jeffery Evans, Valerie Evans, David Evans, Amber Quirk, Jennifer
2 CONC  Evans 5 great-grandchildren sister, Evelyn Abbot and brother, Robert Seitler. The family of Caroline would like to give special thanks to Becca Harnden for taking care of their mother. Services are Sat., May 17, 2008, at 11AM at 
2 CONC Advantage South Chapel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Published in The Oklahoman on May 14, 2008
