1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Obituary for James Joseph Minardi, Sr. James Joseph Minardi, Sr., age 81, of Buford, GA passed away on Tuesday, June 30, 2015. He was preceded in death by his wife of fifty-one years, Bernadette J. Minardi. He is s
2 CONC urvived by his daughter, Vivica Kahl, Buford, GA; sons, Raymond and Martha Minardi, Nashville, TN, Donald and Glenice Minardi, Suwanee, GA, James Minardi, Jr., Auburn, GA, and Jeffrey E. and Patricia Minardi, Buford, GA; twelve gr
2 CONC andchildren; two great grandchildren; and several nieces, nephews, and cousins. Mr. Minardi was born August 11, 1933 in Omaha, Nebraska. He was a veteran of the U.S. Army, and served in the Korean Conflict. He retired from AT&T as
2 CONC  a machine operator after over 30 years. He was a member of Buford Church of God, where he was also a member of Prime Timers Senior Group. Funeral service is scheduled for Friday, July 3, 2015 at 2:00 p.m. in the chapel of Flaniga
2 CONC n Funeral Home with Rev. Danny Smith and Pastor Joey Grizzle officiating. Interment will follow at Broadlawn Memorial Gardens. The family will receive friends on Thursday, July 2, 2015 from 5:00 p.m. until 8:00 p.m. at the funeral
2 CONC  home.
