1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Franklin Clarence Shaffer, son of the late Charles Henry and Francis Bailey Shaffer, was born Dec. 24, 1932 at Janesville, WI.  He departed this life Dec 31, 1997 at St. Bernards Hospital in Jonesboro, AR at the ag
2 CONC e of 65 years and 7 days. Frank was united in marriage to Barbara Jean Ziemsen on Nov. 17, 1956 at Warreville, IL.  To this union, 6 children were born.  Frank spent over 30 years in the military, serving his country in the Korean
2 CONC  War.  After retiring from the Navy he became a Funeral Director and worked for several funeral homes: Higginbotham Funeral Home of Hardy, Tri County of Hardy and Cox-Estes Funeral Home of Salem.  He was a member of the Arkansas F
2 CONC uneral Directors Assn., the Elks Lodge of Cherokee Village, and the Spring Lake Baptist Church of Ozark Acres.   Frank leaves to mourn his passing, his wife Barbara of the home, 2 sons: Mike of Ozark Acres and Scott of Poplar Bluf
2 CONC f, MO; 3 Daughters: Kim Gann of Ash Flat, Karen Shaffer of Batesville, and Peggy Sue Shaffer of Ozark Acres; 6 grandchildren, 1 great-grandchild, and a host of other relatives and friends.  He was preceded in death by 1 brother, 3
2 CONC  sisters, a daughter and his parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 1. Kimberly Ann Shaffer (1957-) 2. Peggy Sue Shaffer (1959-) 3. Michael Joseph Shaffer (1961-) 4. Nancy Jane Shaffer (1964-1964) 5. Karen Marie Shaffer (1967-) 6. Scott Edward Shaffer (1975-)
2 CONT
2 CONT Grandchildren: 1. Amanda Renee Bohall (1978-) 2. James Allen Emanuel (1979-) 3. Melinda Dawn Osborn (1980-) 4. Nicolette Athena Bohall (1981-) 5. Andrew Scott Emanuel (1982-) 6. Kyle Morgan Shaffer (1991-) 7. Lyndsey Beth Shaffer 
2 CONC (2001-) 8. Logan Edward Shaffer (2003-) 9. Franklin Scott Shaffer (2004-)
2 CONT
2 CONT Great Grandchildren: 1. Braden Alexander Graddy (1997-) 2. Matthew Conner Graddy (2004-) 3. Brianna Lynn Johnson (2004-) 4. Nathaniel Ryen Devon Geasler (2006-) 5. Samuel Alexander Payton Geasler (2007-) 6. Lucien Franklin Lee Dul
2 CONC ier (2010-) 7. Anson Beau Cullen Dulier (2012-)
2 CONT
2 CONT 22 Descendants  21 Living as of 2020
