2 CONT
2 CONT Willard R. Madsen, 72
2 CONT
2 CONT VERNON HILLS, IL - Willard R. Madsen, 72, of Vernon Hills, died July 10, 2005 at Northwest Community Hospital, Arlington Heights. He was born August 30, 1932 in Chicago, Cook Co., IL.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a Korea Conflict Veteran serving in the USMC as a Staff Sgt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Willard retired V.P. of Manufacturing/Engineering of Ecomony Engineering.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a member of American Legion Post 911, VFW Post 7369, Marine Corp League and former skeet shooter in Lincoln Park.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the beloved husband of Carol nee Schwendau; loving father of Steven R. (Alyson) Madsen of Muncie, in, Lynn (the late Tom) Ridge of Barrington, IL, Jean (Patrick) Duffy of Littleton, CO and Carolyn (Harvey) Paffenroth of Lak
2 CONC e Forest, Lake Co., IL; dear grandfather of Steven G., Tracy E., Zachary L., Tom Ryan, Alexandra, Meghan, Brent, Erin, Brigid, Blake, Shaw, Katherine and Garrett.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral Mass will be held at 10 a.m. on Thursday, July 14, 2005 at the Church of St. Patrick, 991 S. Waukegan Rd., (corner of Everett) Lake Forest, Lake Co., IL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Interment in Ascension Cemetery, Libertyville, IL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Visitation will be held from 5:00 p.m. to 8:00 p.m. Wednesday at Wenban Funeral Home, 320 E. Vine Ave., Lake Forest
