1 NOTE {geni:about_me} veteran of WWII & Korea
2 CONT
2 CONT Aielt "Bud" Evans Published: Sat, February 24, 1996 12:00 AM
2 CONT
2 CONT EVANS Aielt "Bud", 68, passed away Feb. 21, 1996 in OKC. He was born July 16, 1927 to Walter and Annie Fischer Evans in Eldora, Ia. Bud had been a resident of OKC for 13 years, moving from Chicago. He was a veteran of WWII and Kor
2 CONC ea. Survivors include his wife, Caroline, of the home; sons, Michael Evans of Orlando, Fl, Steven Evans of Lansing, Il, Tracy Evans of Warr Acres, Ok; daughter, Susan Evans of Yukon, Ok; brothers, Gerald Evans of Eldora, Ia, Carro
2 CONC ll Evans of Tinley Park, Il; sisters, Dorothy Van loh of Wellsburg, Ia, Cornetta Young of Detroit, Mi. & 6 grandchildren. Services will be 2:00 p.m. Sat, Feb. 24, at the Smith & Turner Colonial Chapel
2 CONT
2 CONT Archive ID: 637581
2 CONT --------------------
