1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Bendik Evensen Bringerødningen and Margrete Persdatter Raskestugu Olsgard. Mari died probably from complications after giving birth to her second child, Bendik. After her death, Bendik was sent to live 
2 CONC with Mari's relatives in Iowa, and his older brother Hans was sent to Spring Grove, Houston County, Minnesota to live with his father's family.
