1 NAME Frederick /Schorr/ Jr.
2 GIVN Frederick
2 SURN Schorr
2 NSFX Jr.
2 _MARNM Shore
2 NICK Schorr
2 NICK Shores
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 DATE 23 OCT 1731
2 ADDR
3 CITY Muttenz
3 STAE Alsace
3 CTRY France
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 23 OCT 1731
2 PLAC Muttenz, Canton Basel, Switzerland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT AUG 1818
2 ADDR
3 STAE North Carolina
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for NORTH CAROLINA.  [https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A104331  DAR Ancestor #: A104331]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/125156185/frederick-shores
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:  The family name in Switzerland was Schorr, in America it was changed to Shore; however, some spell it Shores (Including DAR & FAG).
2 CONT
2 CONT The Shore family farm was adjacent to the Hoots' farm on Harmon Creek in Yadkin County, North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT The 7 children of Frederick Shore & Barbara Ries are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Mary Shore, b 1766 married Peter Shermer, death date unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Anna Margaretha Shore, b 1767 d after 1818.  married John Binkley, b ca 1765 d after 1818.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Henry Shore, b 1771, Surry Co.,NC d ca 1840 Surry Co.,NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Jacob Shore, b between 1774-1785 d 1819.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  Barbara Shore, b 8/4/1775 Surry Co.,NC d 11/6/1821. married Johann Ludwig Muecke, 1775-1844.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.  John Shore, b 6/20/1780 Surry Co.,NC d 1850 Surry Co., NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.  Elizabeth Shore, b 1787 d 1854, married Daniel Hoots, 1785-1844.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: For info regarding the family of Frederick Shores & Barbara Ries,(Generation 5) see the URL below.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.genealogy.com/ftm/v/i/c/Dawna-J-Vicars-CA/GENE18-0005.html
