1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bernadine Gable
2 CONT
2 CONT Passed away into the hands of the God, on June 13, 2007 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Survived by her daughter, Jennifer; her parents, Frank and Rosann Klen (Mo-on); sister and brothers, Mary Holloway, Gordon Gable, Roschelle and Roger Vaughn, Frankie Klen, Paula and Darrin Janes; along with many nieces, nephews, g
2 CONC reat nieces and nephews. Plus many other family and friends.
2 CONT
2 CONT She volunteered for the Joliet Diocease, and numerous other charities and organizations throughout Joliet. I know that Bernadine will be watching over all of her loved ones, helping to guide them to a full happy and blessed life.
2 CONT
2 CONT In lieu of flowers, donations to her family to be used according to their wishes would be appreciated. Tezak's Home to Celebrate Life
2 CONT
2 CONT 1211 Plainfield Rd.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joliet, IL. 815 722-0524
2 CONT
2 CONT www.tezakfuneralhome.com
2 CONT
2 CONT From where funeral services will be held on Monday at 9:30 am to the Cathedral of St. Raymond Nonnatus for a Mass of Christian Burial to be Celebrated at 10:am. Interment St. Joseph Cemetery. Visitation will be Sunday from 3 to 6 
2 CONC pm.
2 CONT
2 CONT Published in The Herald-News from June 16 to June 17, 2007
