2 CONT
2 CONT Rangdi was the daughter of Osten Svenson Eidal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rangdi married Halvor Olsen Hertsgaard (1802-1875) on October 21, 1830, and they had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Barbo Halvorsdatter Hertsgaard b. 8-1-1831 Gol, Hallingdal, Buskerud, Norway. d. 4-9-1854 Gol, Hallingdal, Buskerud, Norway.
2 CONT m. Endre Endreson "Andrew" (Tryhus) Thompson b. 10-5-1829 d. 2-16-1902 Gol, Hallingdal, Buskerud, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Guri Halvorsdatter Hertsgaard b. 4-24-1838 Gol, Hallingdal, Buskerud, Norway. d. 4-15-1929 Beloit, Rock Co., WI.
2 CONT m. Nils K. Knutsen (Veltehaugen) Hesgard b. 5-7-1824 Gol, Hallingdal, Buskerud, Norway. d. 8-18-1915 Plymouth, Sheboygan Co., WI.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Berget J. Halvorsdatter Hertsgaard b. 9-15-1840 Gol, Hallingdal, Buskerud, Norway. d. 11-6-1940 Orfordville, Rock Co., WI.
2 CONT m. Nils Olsen Brunsvold b. 11-21-1828 Nes, Hallingdal, Buskerud, Norway d. 3-23-1917 Orfordville, Rock Co., WI.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Ingeborg Halvorsdatter Hertsgaard b. 7-9-1844 Gol, Hallingdal, Buskerud, Norway. d. 2-4-1937
2 CONT m. Corp. Halvor Halvorsen Medgorden b. 1-21-1841 Norway d. 11-26-1891 Rock Co., WI.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Olena Hertsgaard b. 4-7-1847 Orfordville, Rock Co., WI. d. 3-12-1936 Mitchell Co., IA.
2 CONT m. Knut Williams b. 6-14-1845 Norway d. 9-14-1937 Saint Ansgar, Mitchell Co., IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Ostine Hertsgaard b. 6-4-1849 Rock Co., WI. d. 8-24-1850 Rock Co., WI.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Osten Hertsgaard b. 8-10-1851 Rock Co., WI. d. 8-1852 Rock Co., WI.
