1 NOTE
2 CONT Came to America in 1848 on the ship "Drafna".  It arrived in NEw York on August 7, 1848 from Drammen with 157 passengers including 57 children and 7 babies.  Captain H. E. Eckersberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pg 173 - Gerhard Naeseth's Book 1847-48 on Immigration to the United States.  #1024.  Kjersti Jørgensdtr. Garnaas [Kirsti Quarve, 56, f], daughter of Jørgen Levorsen Garnaas and Margrethe Olsdtr., born 1791, died 1881.  Settled in
2 CONC  the Rock Prairie settlement, WI; by 1860 to Houston Co., MN.  She had been married first, October 11, 1811, Knud Svendsen Eidal, born 1783?, died 1819.
2 CONT
2 CONT Christened January 16, 1791 Garnaas, Nes Buskerud, Norway.  In the burial records in Trinity church she is listed as Mrs. Timand Eidahl Quarve
