1 NOTE
2 CONT In the church records she is listed as Ingeborg Temansdtr Trulsen, but on cemetery stone she is listed as Ingeborg Temansdtr Gilbertson. Deceased was a woman of remarkable vitality and despite her old age, retained full possession
2 CONC  of her mental faculties up to her death.  She was always of a cheerful disposition and viewed adversity in the light of deserving trial rather than as a burden.  Old Ingeborg will be greatly missed by her many friends both old an
2 CONC d young.  Funeral was held at the N.E.L. church on Wed. by Rev Reque.
2 CONT
2 CONT In her obit it states she was born in 1812.  In 1860 census it states that she is 48 years old.  Also in 1860 census, her son Swen Gilbertson is living with her and Halgrim Trulsen.
