1 NOTE Margit Pladsen, widow of the late Even Pladsen died  suddenly at the home of her son,Christian, west of town Tuesday, December 26. 1899, aged 77 years.  She was about the house as usual Christmas day, but became ill on Tuesday and
2 CONC  passed away, leaving several children of mature age to mourn her departure.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 Jan 1900 - P. S. and Even Evenson of Northwood, ND and Ulen, Minnesota, respectively have been among relatives here the past week. They were called home on the sad mission of attending their mother's funeral.  Even Evenson depar
2 CONC ted for home Tuesday.
