1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT From "Norman County Obituary Index": Martin Bang, one of the pioneer settlers of Ada, died last Friday at Roseray, Canada, where he had resided for the past seven years. His son, Mikle Bang, of Ada, left Saturday to arrange for th
2 CONC e funeral and to bring the remains to Ada for burial. The deceased was 55 years of age, and settled in Ada about 34 years ago. The deceased was well known and had friends all
2 CONT over Norman County.  He is survived by his wife and four children, Mickle, Agnes, Gustav and Birdie, all of this city. Sever Bang, of this city is a brother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin homesteaded 1/4 section of land in Saskatchewan.  Martin died before the family could join him.  His wife Adle then brought the children to Saskatchewan from Ada Minnesota, USA  His son Gustav then took over the farming.  (
2 CONC source Larry Bang).
2 CONT
2 CONT Calculating dates:  Martin lived in Canada in 1935, and lived in Roseray Canada for 7 years...so between 1926-1942
2 CONT Subtracting 34 years from death date shows immigration to Ada, MN in 1883...conflict with 1887.
2 CONT Larry Bang remembers that Martin came to Canada in 1901 and died in 1917.
2 CONT
2 CONT Other notes on "Bang"
2 CONT From Norman County Marriage Index "B" 1882-1906
2 CONT Bang, Martin and  Larson, Adle     Apr 11 1891     Book 1 Page 317  (This is correct)
2 CONT Bang, Sever married  Larson, Anna  May 17 1890    Book  2 Page 243 (This is Martin Bang's brother, source Martin Bang Obituary)
2 CONT
2 CONT Bangs, Knudt H. married Bakken, Carrie  Nov 30 1899  Book  4 page 327  (unknown)
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1906-1915 Index
2 CONT Bang, Oscar married  Steffen, Esther   Sep 3 1915   Book 7   Page 217
2 CONT Oscar is son of Server and Anna (Larson)
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1916-1930 index
2 CONT Bang, Charles Bernhard married  Hartman, Ora A.   Jan 1 1918 Book 7 Page 299 (unknown)
2 CONT Bang, Mickle  married  Arnestad, Ruth Alvilde    Dec 27 1916   Book  7 Page  383 (Larry Bang confirms this).
2 CONT
2 CONT There are Bang families listed in the 1920 Census for Ada, Norman County, Minnesota, USA on page 7 and 15
