1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.ealgood.com/family/a423/i0040751.htm#i40751
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Henry Robert Allgood.  Married 2/24/1827 at Surry County, NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of John Shore & Anna Margaret Groce.  Born 9/18/1807 at Surry County, NC and died 1880-1900 at Morganton, Burke County, NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Shore and Henry Robert Allgood had the following 7 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Forrset Allgood, b ca 1820 at Surry County, NC. Married Rebecca Ashly Groce ca 1877. Born ca 1836 at Morganton, Burke County, NC.  Daughter of Peter Gross & Nancy (?).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Margaret P. Allgood, b August, 1829.
2 CONT
