1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She is the daughter of James Scantlin.  She married Jacob Shore in 1802 in Surry NC.  Together they had 6 children, 4 boys & 2 girls.  After Jacob's death she moved with two sons and a daughter west to Macon Co., M
2 CONC issouri.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/57795175/margaret-shores Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 16 2019, 12:37:00 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Daughter of James Scantlin.  Born in 1781 in South Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Jacob Shore in 1802 in Surry County, NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret & Jacob Shore had 6 children (4 boys & 2 girls):
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  William Dahl Shore, 1804-1885.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  James Shore, b 1806.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Lewis Shore, b 1808.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Mary Shore, b 1810.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  Nancy Shore, b 1811.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.  Alfred Shore, b 1812.
2 CONT
2 CONT After Jacob's death, she moved with two sons & a daughter west to Macon County, Missouri.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Scantlin Shore died on May 19, 1864 and is buried in Baity-Shore Cemetery, Macon County, MO.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: See Generations 3 & 4 at the 2nd URL below for family structure.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/57795175/margaret-shores
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.fmoran.com/schor.html
