1 NAME Nancy /Shores/
2 GIVN Nancy
2 SURN Shores
2 _MARNM Baity
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Baity-Shore Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 STAE Missouri
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1809
2 ADDR
3 STAE North Carolina
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 OCT 1879
2 ADDR
3 CITY La Plata
3 STAE Missouri
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nancy is the daughter of Margaret (Scantlin) and Jacob Shores.  She married Enoch Baity and together they had seven children.  After her father's death her family moved west.  They first settled in Morgan, Illinois
2 CONC  where four of her seven children were born.  Her family, her mother, and two brothers finally settled in Macon Co. Missouri.  Two other brothers and a sister went to Arkansas.  She and Enoch settled in Richland Township where the
2 CONC y had a farm.  She continued to live on the family farm with George and his family after Enoch's death.  She saw her two sons go off to war for the North during the Civil War and return.  She saw four of her seven children grow to
2 CONC  adulthood.  She had at least 26 grandchildren before her death.  Nancy had many heartbreaking events in her life, but her strength of character helped her carry on.  She is my 2nd great grandmother.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/57794905/nancy-baity Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 16 2019, 12:35:29 UTC''
