2 CONT
2 CONT                                                                    Hartwick Gerald Mellem
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:  Sep. 3, 1903 Northwood Worth County Iowa, USA  Death:  Mar. 31, 1981 Mason City Cerro Gordo County Iowa, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary - Hartwick G. Mellem, 77, Northwood, died Tuesday ( March 31, 1981) at a Mason City hospital.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services will be 1:30 p.m. Thursday at the First Lutheran Shell Rock Church, Northwood, with the Rev. Alf Merseth officiating. Burial will be in Sunset Rest Cemetery, Northwood. Visitation is after 4 p.m. today at Conner C
2 CONC olonial Chapel, Northwood.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Mellem was the son Charles and Rena (Myli) Mellem. He was a graduate of Northwood High School and attended business school in Mason City. He married Ferne Harmon in July 1928. Mr. Mellem was a farmer and hauled gravel until hi
2 CONC s retirement. He was a member of First Lutheran Shell Rock Church, Northwood.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include his wife, Ferne; one daughter, Judy Boutelle, Salem Ore.; one son, Jewell Dean Mellem, Osage and one Brother, Carlin Mellem, of Arizona.
