2 CONT 1925 Iowa Census: Grove, Worth, Iowa (a) C. G. Mellem 55 born abt 1870 Iowa; parents Gelbrand O Millem born abt 1847 Norway and Carrina Ellingston Swenson born Norway (b) Randine Millem 52 born abt 1873 Iowa; parents; Halgin Myli 
