1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ida Christina Nelson Sanders, Nov 12,1886-Nov 3,1975
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Ida C. (Nelson) Sanders, 88, died Nov. 3 following an extended illness. Funeral services will be Thursday at 2 PM in St. John's Lutheran Church here with the Rev. LeeRoy Eikanger officiating. Burial will be in the Zoar Luther
2 CONC an Cemetery at Grenville, SD. Mrs. Sanders was born Nov. 12, 1886, in Pope County, MN to Mr. And Mrs. Ole Nelson. She married Ole Sanders Dec. 2, 1902, at Wist, SD. Survivors include six daughters, Mrs. Clara Pemrick, Waubay, Mrs.
2 CONC  John (Inga) Hanson, Peever, Mrs. Albert (Gladys) Hanson and Mrs. Eddie (Doris) Calrson, Turlock, CA, Mrs. Art (Lorraine) Moen, Roslyn, and Mrs. John (Florence) Meier, Aberdeen; one brother, Martin Nelson, Sisseton; two sisters, M
2 CONC rs. Anne Iverson, Sisseton, and Mrs. Thea Hendrickson, Minneapolis; 11 grandchildren; 38 great-grandchildren; and 12 great-great-grandchildren.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/136358436/ida-christina-sanders Find 
2 CONC A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 25 2019, 18:47:29 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
