1 NOTE Per:  Steinar Vissebråten letter to Norway-L Feb 15, 2003 -- Liv came from Eidal in Rukkedalen 6 kilometer from Nesbyen and I live in the same area.
2 CONT
2 CONT Letter from Ruth Engnor to Norway-L Feb. 14, 2003 - Dear Pete, Thank you for the information.  I wrote to a Christen Berg in Bergheim.  He told me that my Knud Eriksen Berg family lived in Nobben, Fla then moved to the Berg farm i
2 CONC n Nes around 1836.  The Nobben area, he said is beautifully placed beside the river Hallindalselva.  There aren't any buildings left on the farm.  6 km away is the Berg farm, which he still lives on.  He also told me that I have m
2 CONC any relatives in Fla. Halgrim Knudsen Berg/Hellerud was Knud's son and my great grandmother's brother.  He was left behind in Fla when the family went to the states in 1850.  I am thinking that maybe these are the people whom I am
2 CONC  related to.  Also to Christen Berg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Do you remember seeing any of these areas?  Thanks so much.  Ruth in Oregon
2 CONT P.S.  Where did you rent your car? Nesbyen?  What was the name of the B&B in Nesbyen.  Ruth
2 CONT
