2 CONT Pg. 172 - Gerhard Naeseth's book on Emigration to America 1847-48 - #1015 - Ole Nielsen Onsgard [Ole N. Onsgard, 42, m] son of Nels Olsen Brunsvold and Kari Hendrichsdtr, born June 1, 1804.  Emigrated to Plymouth Twp., Rock County
2 CONC , Wisconsin.  Farmer. Died October 27, 1884, married December 27, 1833 Barbro Olsdtr. Hova #1016
