1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Twin of Christian. Born Jul 21th., 1805, christened Nov. 10th 1805.   Here is what i found out from old documents. Thor Olsen Rukke bought the farm Timelidokken,  (farm 66/7 in Rukke Valley) in 1842. and sold it in
2 CONC  1880. (deed from Thor and his second wife Birgit Hansedt. to Christian Halvorsen was signed that year). So Thor and family never left for USA. Thor married Astrid Knudsdt, Brunsvald Okt.21th. 1831, she died Des. 29th 1852. In Jul
2 CONC y 1854 he married Birgit or Bergit Hansedt, Gundvaldsrukke. 
