2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Guri was the daughter of Halvor Olsen Hertsgaard (1802-1875) and Rangdi Eidal (1812-1892).
2 CONT
2 CONT Guri was born April 24, 1838 in, Norway. She died in 1929. According to her obituary found in the Janesville Gazette, which was found in the Luther Valley Dunbar Collection, she was buried in the Luther Valley Cemetery, Beloit, Ro
2 CONC ck Co., Wisconsin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Guri married Nils K. Knutsen Veltehaugen on March 5, 1854, and had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Maggie Hesgard b. 5-14-1855 d. 7-23-1899
2 CONT m. Amos N. Golberg 2-14-1857 St. Ansgar, IA. d. 9-19-1946 Cass Co., N.D.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Rangdi Hesgard b. 1-29-1857
2 CONT m. Hendrick Hendrickson
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Knut N. Hesgard b. 8-31-1859 d. 1948
2 CONT m. Ingeborg Golberg b. 4-24-1859 IA. d. 1948 N.D.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Barbra Hesgard b. 9-14-1860 WI. d. 4-1-1946
2 CONT m. Haavel Eidal d. 5-19-1935
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Halvor N. Hesgard b. 2-3-1863 WI. d. 1949
2 CONT m. Barbara Synstegard b. 3-1858 Avon, Rock Co., WI. d. 4-29-1928 WI.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Nels N. Hesgard b. 12-3-1868 Plymouth, Sheboygan Co., WI. d. 5-14-1911 Plymouth, Sheboygan Co., WI.
2 CONT m. Tilda Marie Aamoth b. 12-12-1875 Rock Co., WI. d. 3-3-1955 Milwaukie, Clackamas Co., OR.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Carl Jacob Hesgard b. 2-27-1870 d. 3-14-1959
2 CONT m. Clara Aamoth b. 10-17-1871 Twin Valley, Norman Co., MN. d. 9-29-1964 Orfodville, Rock Co., WI.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Gurine Hesgard b. 12-26-1872
2 CONT m. Chris Gilbertson b. 2-1866
2 CONT
