2 CONT February 9, 1887 - Knud Gilbertson and Anders B. Foss of Spring Grove called while here on business one day last week.  Caledonia Journal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Caledonia Journal May 31, 1899 - Spring Grove News - Mr. and Mrs. Knud Gilbertson drove to Black Hammer Thursday to see their daughter, Mrs. Peter Holje and family.
2 CONT
2 CONT January 21, 1904- Knudt Gilbertson employed several teams to haul brick from the train last Thursday to his lots in Gilbertson addition where he expects to erect a new dwelling next spring.
2 CONT
2 CONT May 5, 1904- Knute Gilbertson has commenced excavating for the erection of his brick house on his lots in the Gilbertson addition, Spring Grove.
