2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Last Name:  Pladson
2 CONT First Name:  Ostinus
2 CONT Born:  1900
2 CONT Died:   1966
2 CONT Publication:  Hatton Centennial, 1884-1984: A Century of Change. 1983.
2 CONT Institute Call Number: F644.H38 H38 1984  Page No: 321
2 CONT **************
2 CONT From the Hatton Book.    Ostinus was born in Newburgh in 1900 and died in 1966.  His parents were Bendick Pladson and Andrianne Kittleson.  His wife was Clara Sondreal born 1900 and died in 1960.  Her parents were Engebret Sondrea
2 CONC l and Karen Torgerson.  Their five children were: Lloyd of Moorhead, MN and he works for Midwest Trucking Co., Graydon of Wadena, MN is an instructor at Wadena Tech., Eunice Paaverud at Austin, MN, works in the Social Security Off
2 CONC ice,  Twila Westvedt of Hatton, ND is a homemaker and part owner of the Ceramic Shop in Hatton,  Shirley Hines of  Helena, MT is an insurance Office employee.  The Pladson farm home was located in Section 18 Newburgh Twp. and was 
2 CONC his parents' homestead farm.  He was a life long member of Goose River Lutheran Church.  She was a member of the Bethel Lutheran Church before their marriage.
