2 CONT
2 CONT The Life Summary of Albert When Albert Hendrickson was born on 4 October 1885, in Sheyenne, Eddy, North Dakota, United States, his father, Ole Hendrickson, was 45 and his mother, Olase Evensdan, was 39. He married Marie (Mary) Gut
2 CONC terud about 1904, in Benson, North Dakota, United States. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 1 daughter. He lived in Gates Township, Eddy, North Dakota, United States in 1910 and School District 11, Sheridan, Montana, Un
2 CONC ited States for about 10 years. He died on 27 October 1950, in Williston, Williams, North Dakota, United States, at the age of 65, and was buried in Williston, Williams, North Dakota, United States.
